## TESTING

### Guidelines for UI TESTS

#### Appium

- Implement the Page Object pattern for maintainable tests
- Create files in PantryPal.Mobile.UITests
- Put page classes into Pages directory, test classes into Tests directory
- Keep test data in separate directory
- Use AutomationId for element selection
- Avoid XPath selectors, add missing AutomationId instead
- Use helpers like WaitUntilVisible, WaitUntilClickable for synchronization
- Leverage API testing for backend validation
- Use expect assertions with specific matchers